@PreAuthorize hasAuthority 'audio:delete' / 'project:delete'
then findByAudioCodeAndRemovedAtIsNull /
findByProjectCodeAndRemovedAtIsNull

removed_at = NULL, removed_by = NULL, updated_at / updated_by stamped, save;
project also runs restoreByProject on all four media repos
200 OK — AudioResponseDTO, or RestoreResult carrying the four counts
